        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Monster Slayer: Motion Edition》<br>🎯 <strong>No VR headset needed!</strong> Just a standard webcam for motion-sensing action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏹 <strong>Revolutionary Motion Experience</strong><br>• Zero setup: Works with any laptop/desktop webcam (360p+) <br>• 1:1 movement tracking: Arm swings = in-game attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique classes:</strong><br>🔸 <strong>Archer</strong>: Precise bow shots to snipe monsters<br>🔸 <strong>Shadow Ninja</strong>: Rapid shuriken combos<br>🔸 <strong>Elemental Mage</strong>: AoE fireballs &amp; whirlwinds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Progression System</strong><br>• Random loot chests with:<br>✅ <strong>Attack boosts</strong>: Fire/Multi-shot/Cyclone<br>✅ <strong>Defense buffs</strong>: Shields/Freeze/Lifesteal<br>• Auto-difficulty adjustment based on movement intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌋 <strong>Dual Modes</strong><br><strong>Story Mode (12 levels)</strong><br>Fight through:<br>🦅 Storm Hawks → 🕷️ Venom Queen → 🐉 Ultimate Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong><br>Infinite monster waves - <i>&quot;How long can you last?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 <strong>Tips</strong><br>→ Single-player recommended<br>→ 2m×2m play area + good lighting<br>→ 3-second gesture calibration</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Monster Slayer: Motion Edition》<br>🎯 <strong>No VR headset needed!</strong> Just a standard webcam for motion-sensing action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏹 <strong>Revolutionary Motion Experience</strong><br>• Zero setup: Works with any laptop/desktop webcam (360p+) <br>• 1:1 movement tracking: Arm swings = in-game attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique classes:</strong><br>🔸 <strong>Archer</strong>: Precise bow shots to snipe monsters<br>🔸 <strong>Shadow Ninja</strong>: Rapid shuriken combos<br>🔸 <strong>Elemental Mage</strong>: AoE fireballs &amp; whirlwinds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Progression System</strong><br>• Random loot chests with:<br>✅ <strong>Attack boosts</strong>: Fire/Multi-shot/Cyclone<br>✅ <strong>Defense buffs</strong>: Shields/Freeze/Lifesteal<br>• Auto-difficulty adjustment based on movement intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌋 <strong>Dual Modes</strong><br><strong>Story Mode (12 levels)</strong><br>Fight through:<br>🦅 Storm Hawks → 🕷️ Venom Queen → 🐉 Ultimate Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong><br>Infinite monster waves - <i>&quot;How long can you last?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 <strong>Tips</strong><br>→ Single-player recommended<br>→ 2m×2m play area + good lighting<br>→ 3-second gesture calibration</p>",
        "short_description": "Monster Slayer: Motion Edition - VR-free motion gaming! Use any webcam (720p+) to control 3 classes (Archer/Ninja/Mage) with real movements. Smash chests for buffs. 12-level campaign &amp; endless mode. AI motion tracking, auto-difficulty, 2m² play area.",
